   "Every router here",
   "shares one channel."
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "l1b",
  "a": 2.34,
  "b": 3.849,
  "l": [
   "So who gets to talk?"
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "l2a",
  "a": 4.05,
